<title>BELGIUM: EU vets Mannesmann control of tubes venture.</title>
<headline>EU vets Mannesmann control of tubes venture.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Friday it was starting a routine probe into a proposal by Mannesmannrohren-Werke, a unit of Mannesmann AG, to take sole control of Mannesmann Hoesch Prazisrohr GmbH (MHP).</p>
<p>MHP is a 50/50 steel joint venture between Mannesmann and Fried. Krupp AG Hoesch-Krupp. It makes and sells precision tubes and other tubes.</p>
<p>The Commission said in a notice to be published in the EU's Official Journal that the deal was submitted to it for clearance on March 14 under European merger rules which ban creation or strengthening of dominant positions.</p>
<p>It has a month from that date to clear the operation or start a full probe.</p>
<p>-- Amelia Torres 322 2876841</p>
